		{"id":"software-eating-points","type":"text","text":"## Что меняется\n\n- Software становится ядром бизнеса, а не вспомогательным инструментом.\n- Традиционные отрасли перестраиваются цифровыми компаниями: книги — Amazon, видео — Netflix, музыка — Spotify/iTunes.\n- Конкурентное преимущество смещается в код, данные, платформы и скорость разработки.\n- Каждая компания должна готовиться к тому, что её отрасль будет \"съедена\" софтом — или стать тем, кто ест первым.","x":-136,"y":340,"width":870,"height":356},
		{"id":"1b51526773ad28f0","type":"text","text":"|   # | Компания          | Market cap, конец 2011 | Годовая выручка | Комментарий                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |\n| --: | ----------------- | ---------------------: | --------------: | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n|   1 | ExxonMobil        |                $406.3B |        ~$486.4B | 2011 revenue                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |\n|   2 | Apple             |                $376.4B |         $108.0B | Apple reported FY2011 annual revenue of about $108B. ([Apple](https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2011/10/18Apple-Reports-Fourth-Quarter-Results/?utm_source=chatgpt.com \"Apple Reports Fourth Quarter Results\"))                                 |\n|   3 | PetroChina        |                $276.8B |        ~$310.1B | RMB 2,003,843m turnover, converted to USD. ([SEC](https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1108329/000119312512184222/d337648d20f.htm?utm_source=chatgpt.com \"Form 20-F\"))                                                                    |\n|   4 | Royal Dutch Shell |                $236.7B |        ~$470.2B | 2011 revenue / revenue and other income                                                                                                                                                                                                      |\n|   5 | ICBC              |                $228.2B |         ~$72.8B | Bank, net interest income was RMB 362.8B ([HKEX News](https://www.hkexnews.hk/listedco/listconews/sehk/2012/0329/LTN201203291124.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com \"2011 annual results announcement\"))                                             |\n|   6 | Microsoft         |                $218.4B |          $69.9B | Microsoft FY2011 revenue $69.94B. ([Source](https://news.microsoft.com/source/2011/07/21/microsoft-reports-record-fourth-quarter-and-full-year-results/?utm_source=chatgpt.com \"Microsoft Reports Record Fourth-Quarter and Full-Year ...\")) |\n|   7 | IBM               |                $216.7B |         $106.9B | IBM 2011 revenue $106.9B. ([IBM](https://www.ibm.com/investor/att/pdf/IBM_Annual_Report_2011.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com \"2011 Annual Report\"))                                                                                               |\n|   8 | Chevron           |                $211.9B |        ~$244.4B | Sales and other operating revenues. ([Nairametrics](https://nairametrics.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/04/Chevron2011AnnualReport.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com \"Annual Report 2011 Chevron\"))                                                    |\n|   9 | Walmart           |                $204.7B |        ~$443.9B | Fiscal year ended Jan. 31, 2012 net sales. ([SEC](https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/104169/000119312512134679/d270972d10k.htm?utm_source=chatgpt.com \"Form 10-K\"))                                                                     |\n|  10 | China Mobile      |                $196.1B |         ~$81.7B | RMB 527,999m operating revenue, converted to USD. ([HKEX News](https://www.hkexnews.hk/listedco/listconews/sehk/2013/0327/LTN20130327405.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com \"China Mobile Limited\"))                                                 |","x":1060,"y":346,"width":1320,"height":514},
